## Real relux selected-engine evidence

`approvedRealReluxHostCompatibility` drives `LibSSH2TransportFactory` against
the approved real SSH service through an owner-approved local byte-forwarding
fixture path. It retains no host, address, account, key path, key material,
fingerprint, command output, or remote content. An SSH agent supplies the opaque
signing operation; raw host evidence reaches policy before credential lookup.

Three consecutive current-tree runs exited 0:

