## Outcome

ADR-014 now records the binding human-approved libssh2 M0 selection with every
selected-engine mandatory row green and preserves ReluxNIOSSH as comparative
`FAIL` / `NOT RUN` evidence. The two independent-review findings are closed:

1. the selected adapter now executes a privacy-safe compatibility row against
